{#- Résumé landing page. Front matter lives in r.11tydata.js; the redirect
    itself is the <meta http-equiv="refresh"> that base.njk emits. This markup
    is what the reader sees for those two seconds (and what they see for good,
    if their browser has meta-refresh disabled). #}
<h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
<p class="subtitle">{{ site.tagline }}</p>

<p>Hi{% if app.company %}, {{ app.company }}{% endif %} — thanks for following the
link{% if app.role %} on the {{ app.role }} résumé{% endif %}. Sending you along
to the real site now.</p>

<p><a href="{{ redirect }}">Continue →</a> (if nothing happens in a moment)</p>
